http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Security First</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Enterprise-grade encryption and security measures</div></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm text-center\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-4 p-3 bg-primary/10 rounded-full w-fit\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">User Control</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">You have full control over your data and privacy settings</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-16\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Information We Collect</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl mx-auto\">We collect only the information necessary to provide our services and improve your experience</p></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">Account Information</div><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Email, name, company details for account management</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg><span>Retention: <!-- -->Until account deletion</span></div></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">Usage Data</div><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">How you interact with our services and features</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg><span>Retention: <!-- -->2 years, then anonymized</span></div></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">Technical Data</div><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">IP addresses, browser type, device information</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg><span>Retention: <!-- -->90 days for security purposes</span></div></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">Support Data</div><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Communications and files shared with our support team</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg><span>Retention: <!-- -->3 years for service improvement</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-16\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">How We Use Your Information</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Your data helps us provide better services while maintaining your privacy</p></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Service Provision</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-muted-foreground\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Deliver and maintain our AI-powered guidance services</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Process transactions and manage your account</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Provide customer support and respond to inquiries</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Service Improvement</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-muted-foreground\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Analyze usage patterns to improve our services</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Develop new features based on user feedback</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Ensure security and prevent fraud</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-16\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Data Sharing &amp; Third Parties</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl mx-auto\">We never sell your personal data. We only share information when necessary and with your consent.</p></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6 pt-6\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-red-600\">We Never Share</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-muted-foreground\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full\"></div><span>Personal data with advertisers</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full\"></div><span>Your information for marketing purposes</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full\"></div><span>Data with third parties without consent</span></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-green-600\">We May Share</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-muted-foreground\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full\"></div><span>With service providers under strict contracts</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full\"></div><span>When required by law or legal process</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full\"></div><span>With your explicit consent</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-16\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Your Privacy Rights</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl mx-auto\">You have full control over your personal information</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Access &amp; Portability</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Request a copy of your data or transfer it to another service</p></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Correction &amp; Updates</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Update or correct inaccurate information in your account</p></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Deletion</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Request deletion of your account and associated data</p></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Opt-Out</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Unsubscribe from communications and marketing emails</p></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Data Processing</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Limit how we process your data for specific purposes</p></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Complaints</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">File complaints with relevant data protection authorities</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Questions About Your Privacy?</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Our privacy team is here to help. Contact us with any questions about your data or this policy.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"><butt